    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burger Wars is an idle clicker game, in which you click a burger. Equip better items, defeat higher level monsters and receive better rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a random burger ingredient every 3 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic drop:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common 77%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasty 23%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating the first enemy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common 64%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasty 32.4%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare 3.6%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating Magic Forest:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common 51.5%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasty 38%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare 8.2%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic 2.3%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase Recipes with in-game currency to combine different ingredients for additional damage!</p>",
